      "I’m a great art lover. I look at beautiful paintings and {{sculptures}} and wish I could be artistic. I can’t draw or paint to save my life. I wonder why some people are so {{talented}} and can create amazing pictures, when other people, like me, can’t even draw good {{matchstick}} figures. I would like to fill my house with art from all over the world. It’s {{interesting}} to see how different cultures have different kinds of art. There’s nothing better than visiting art galleries when you go to another country. I prefer more {{traditional}} art. I don’t really understand a lot of modern art. I look at an {{exhibit}} of a pile of bricks in a museum but can’t see how it’s art. I always laugh when my {{children}} say, “Daddy, I can do better than that!” I often think they can.",
    spellingWords: ["sculptures", "talented", "matchstick", "interesting", "traditional"],
    sentences: [{ text: "I’m a great art lover.", start: 2.91, end: 5.33 }, { text: "I look at beautiful paintings and sculptures and wish I could be artistic.", start: 5.38, end: 10.45 }, { text: "I can’t draw or paint to save my life.", start: 10.5, end: 14.07 }, { text: "I wonder why some people are so talented and can create amazing pictures, when other people, like me, can’t even draw good matchstick figures.", start: 14.12, end: 25.71 }, { text: "I would like to fill my house with art from all over the world.", start: 25.76, end: 30.35 }, { text: "It’s interesting to see how different cultures have different kinds of art.", start: 30.4, end: 35.45 }, { text: "There’s nothing better than visiting art galleries when you go to another country.", start: 35.5, end: 41.17 }, { text: "I prefer more traditional art.", start: 41.22, end: 43.71 }, { text: "I don’t really understand a lot of modern art.", start: 43.76, end: 46.91 }, { text: "I look at an exhibit of a pile of bricks in a museum but can’t see how it’s art.", start: 46.96, end: 52.97 }, { text: "I always laugh when my children say, “Daddy, I can do better than that!", start: 53.02, end: 58.05 }, { text: "” I often think they can.", start: 58.1, end: 59.51 }],
