    sentences: [{ text: "I really want to have more knowledge.", start: 4.83, end: 6.85 }, { text: "My general knowledge is pretty good but I want it to be better.", start: 6.9, end: 10.85 }, { text: "When I was a kid, I loved quiz programmes on the television.", start: 10.9, end: 14.85 }, { text: "I used to read lots of encyclopedias to build up my knowledge.", start: 14.9, end: 19.85 }, { text: "I now know most of the world’s capitals and which animals and birds are the fastest, and how many bones there are in the human body, etc.", start: 19.9, end: 29.89 }, { text: "I love watching the news and this helps me get more knowledge.", start: 29.94, end: 34.59 }, { text: "Even though I think I know quite a lot, I always meet people who are really knowledgeable.", start: 34.64, end: 40.79 }, { text: "It seems some people know everything about everything.", start: 40.84, end: 44.79 }, { text: "They are just like walking encyclopedias.", start: 44.84, end: 48.97 }, { text: "I wonder if they’re happy with the amount of knowledge they have inside their brain.", start: 49.02, end: 53.17 }],
